  m_text: "Being alone for the first time, I am overwhelmed with feelings of freedom,
    peace, and, honestly fright. It seems I still have nightmares of that Tiger.
    Is it a suppressed memory? I wonder. \nDoctor Ali said not to dwell on it and
    keep busy, so I will do that."
